---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import EntryList from '../components/EntryList.astro';
import { SITE } from '../config';
import { getEntries } from '../lib/entries';
import { url } from '../lib/url';

const recent = (await getEntries()).slice(0, 5);
---
<Base>
  <section class="mission" aria-label="Why this site exists">
    <p class="en">{SITE.mission.en}</p>
    <p class="zh" lang="zh-Hant">
      {/* Keep each clause whole so a line never breaks inside a word. */}
      
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="intro">
    <p>Hi hi hi! I’m Ping, and this is my little corner of the internet.</p>

    <p>I write to think, to connect with people, and hopefully to inspire someone.</p>

    <p>
      Several years ago, I came across this famous medical aphorism: <br />
      <em>“To cure sometimes, to relieve often, to comfort always.”</em>  <br />
      It reminds doctors the importance of the human side of medicine: caring for the people.

      
    </p>
      For data scientists, I’d like to think of our mission as:
    <p class="motto"><em><strong>“To predict sometimes, to estimate often, to enlighten always.”</strong></em></p>

     <p>
      And then we need tools to do that. On this website, you'll find a collection of data science methods to help you expand your knowledge, understand the world a little better, and perhaps make better decisions.
    </p>

     <p>
      However, do remember George Box’s words:<br />
      <em>“All models are wrong, but some are useful.”</em>
    </p>

    <p>
      Also don’t forget John von Neumann's:<br />
      <em>“In mathematics you don’t understand things. You just get used to them.”</em>
    </p>



     <p>
     :) 
    </p>



    

    <p><a href={url('/toolbox/')}>Open the toolbox</a></p>
  </section>

  {recent.length > 0 && (
    <section class="recent">
      <h2>Recently added</h2>
      <EntryList entries={recent} showDomain />
    </section>
  )}

  <section class="elsewhere">
    <h2>Elsewhere</h2>
    <p>
      {SITE.links.map((l, i) => (
        <>
          <a href={l.href}>{l.label}</a>{i < SITE.links.length - 1 && ', '}
        </>
      ))}
    </p>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .mission { margin-bottom: 3.5rem; }
  .mission p { margin: 0; font-weight: 300; line-height: 1.2; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
  .en { text-wrap: balance; font-size: clamp(2rem, 5.5vw, 2.25rem); }
  .zh {
    margin-top: 0.75rem !important;
    font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 2.4vw, 1.5rem);
    color: var(--muted);
    letter-spacing: 0.04em !important;
  }
  .zh span { display: inline-block; }
  .intro { max-width: 36rem; margin-bottom: 4rem; }
  .intro p:last-child { margin: 0; }
  .recent, .elsewhere { margin-bottom: 3.5rem; }
  h2 { font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
</style>
